              "exam_name": "NEET 2017 · NCERT",
              "question": "<p>Preeti reached the metro station and found that the escalator was not working. She walked up the stationary escalator in time&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(t_1.\\)</span>&nbsp;On other days, if she remains stationary on the moving escalator, then the escalator takes her up in time&nbsp;<span class=\"math-tex\">\\(t_2.\\)</span>&nbsp;The time taken by her to walk upon the moving escalator will be:</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"min-width: 300px;\"><tbody><tr><td>1.</td><td><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{t_1t_2}{t_2-t_1}\\)</span></td><td>2.</td><td><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{t_1t_2}{t_2+t_1}\\)</span></td></tr><tr><td>3.</td><td><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(t_1-t_2\\)</span></td><td>4.</td><td><span class=\"math-tex\">\\(\\dfrac{t_1+t_2}{2}\\)</span></td></tr></tbody></table>",
